## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical multi-tenant QoS design, CKNE-to-RESOURCE mapping, and a simple yet effective rebalancing loop for a FaaS platform.

## Key Concepts

- CKNE-to-concurrency mapping for tenants
- Baseline SLA and fairness guarantees
- Minute-by-minute rebalancing logic
- Telemetry, metrics, and observability
- Practical payload handling and testing

## Code Example

```javascript
// Sketch: compute per-tenant quotas given totalCap and ckne
function rebalance(tenants, totalCap) {
  // simple proportional allocation based on CKNE, with floor baseline
  const sumCKNE = tenants.reduce((s,t)=>s+t.ckne,0);
  return tenants.map(t => {
    const p = t.ckne / sumCKNE;
    return {tenant: t.tenant, quota: Math.max(1, Math.round(p * totalCap))};
  });
}
```

